  "title": "Subscribing with subscriptions/listen",
  "summary": "Maya listens to Theo's board, one thread, her inbox, and a board she cannot read. The acknowledgement leaves out the board she cannot read. Theo replies; Maya gets update hints and reads the change by cursor.",
